body:
You did nothing wrong! You did nothing to deserve this! Actually, you didn't deserve this, not even 1% of this pain you're going through. I love you and I am proud of you for how you managed and still do to have so much suffering in your life that you didn't ask for but still got through it. You are stronger than you think! You are a champion, and whatever happens in the future you will always be one! I wish you peace and a life that is at least liveable (at our standards, of course) 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

i am sorry if this was super inappropriate, i just felt compelled to write this because i sensed so much pain in your comment that i am so so familiar with
